  "title": "Bristol Life Through A Lens",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><em>15th August 2015</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Our photographer Stef Formica has been out and about in Bristol this week armed with her camera and capturing life throughout the city. Here’s a few shots of everyday Bristol life being lived by some of the individuals who make up this vibrant and diverse place we’re very happy to call home.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-111.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-9270\" src=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-111-675x450.jpg\" alt=\"bp-11\" width=\"675\" height=\"450\" srcset=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-111-675x450.jpg 675w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-111-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-111-120x80.jpg 120w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-111.jpg 1000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 675px) 100vw, 675px\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-5.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-9266\" src=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-5-300x450.jpg\" alt=\"bp-5\" width=\"300\" height=\"450\" srcset=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-5-300x450.jpg 300w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-5-200x300.jpg 200w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-5.jpg 667w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-12.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-9271\" src=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-12-300x450.jpg\" alt=\"bp-12\" width=\"300\" height=